{'symbol': 'HWM', 'date': '2022-11-17 16:30:00', 'title': 'HOWMET AEROSPACE BOARD APPROVES PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF HOWMET AEROSPACE (NYSE:HWM) TODAY DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 93.75 CENTS PER SHARE ON THE OUTSTANDING $3.75 CUMULATIVE PREFERRED STOCK (“CLASS A STOCK”) OF THE COMPANY, TO BE PAID ON JANUARY 1, 2023 TO THE HOLDERS OF RECORD OF THE CLASS A STOCK AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 9, 2022.'}